      progressColor: ['#515871', '#386551', '#17628F', '#3A469A', '#905B01', '#864B17', '#932B2B', '#720846', '#601B7B', '#692DBA', '#492EAC', '#955CFC']
    }
  },
  async mounted() {
    const res = await vipdetail()
    this.fanlist = res.fanlist
    this.viplist = res.viplist.map(item => {
      return {
        vipbg: this.vipbgList[Number(item.viplevel)],
        vipTag: this.vipTagList[Number(item.viplevel)],
        nextVipTag: this.vipTagList[Number(item.nextviplevel)],
        progress: item.curmons / item.limitmons > 1 ? 100 : item.curmons / item.limitmons * 100,
        ...item
      }
    })

    this.initVipInfo()
  },
  // mounted() {

  // },
  methods: {
    cardChange() {
      this.currentIndex = this.$refs.cardSwiper.$swiper.activeIndex
    },
    async initVipInfo() {
      const res = await getVipInfo()
      this.currentIndex = Number(res.viplevel)
      await this.$nextTick()
      this.$refs.cardSwiper.$swiper.slideTo(Number(res.viplevel))
    }
  }

}
</script>
